# Bat (2026-11-21): native 16x16 frames, front view, drawn as the left half and mirrored (`mirror`). Exported by
# tools/enemy_sprites.py into assets/images/enemy/Bat.png in the cells Bat.java reads (sprite_layouts.ENEMY_SHEETS).
# up, mid, level, down: the flap (IDLE plays up, mid, level, down, level at 0.03 s; RUN repeats it); flash, fold, tumble,
# drop: the death (HIT), a white flash, then the wings fold, eyes shut, and it tumbles head down; dead: the body it leaves
# (D101, #478), lying on its side on the floor, one wing spread flat, eyes shut, drawn whole (not mirrored), resting on row 14, the floor line of the
# bat's body hitbox.
# Danger family, its own red: a sooty body f with ff6b57 eyes and pale fangs, dark wine membranes d/m (the red mob's shade,
# off the beetle's 86101f) crossed by scarlet finger bones f80440. The moon rim (D92) lights the ink contour on export.
size 16 16
color k 0b0814
color f 2a1418
color F 4c2a30
color d 3a0010
color m 6c0014
color R f80440
color e ff6b57
color t f0e0c8
color W ffffff
